{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Old school RTS is back!</strong> <i>Outlive 25</i> is the remastered version of the game originally released in 2000, that will be featuring enhanced graphics and sound, an updated Campaign Editor, Steam multiplayer support, and much more. Get ready for a battle of unprecedented proportions, fought to achieve supremacy\u2014and above all\u2014to ensure humanity\u2019s survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057780/extras/a775e2fb0254a9f16dd79767c352d8a0.avif?t=1760360775\" width=616 height=84 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057780/extras/34e04f2fccde3d227d34c47700cb2f3c.poster.avif?t=1760360775\" width=800 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057780/extras/34e04f2fccde3d227d34c47700cb2f3c.webm?t=1760360775\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057780/extras/34e04f2fccde3d227d34c47700cb2f3c.mp4?t=1760360775\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Outlive\u00a025</i> is a real-time strategy game where your skills will be tested across incredible scenarios in epic campaigns for the survival of the human race and planet Earth. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In this demo version, get ready to play Outlive 25's official PRE-CAMPAIGN</strong>: meet (or remember!) the basic machanics and witness the very beginning of this adventure. Three full campaigns will be available in the full game once it is released.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo only supports single player mode. Outlive 25's full version will also feature multiplayer for up to 16 players simultaneously.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057780/extras/00b8ea834ad167fa0501953ef600240d.poster.avif?t=1760360775\" width=800 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057780/extras/00b8ea834ad167fa0501953ef600240d.webm?t=1760360775\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057780/extras/00b8ea834ad167fa0501953ef600240d.mp4?t=1760360775\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MORE OF WHAT YOU WILL FIND IN THE FULL GAME:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Campaign Editor:</strong>\u00a0Create and share your own maps and campaigns with friends and other players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Research Tree:</strong> Upgrade your units and make your buildings more efficient during matches, making each battle unique.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Espionage &amp; Counterespionage:</strong> Scout enemy bases, intercept incoming missiles, and carry out other covert actions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pathing System:</strong> Automate unit behaviors so you can focus entirely on your strategy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diplomacy:</strong> Forge alliances with other armies to take down your opponents.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4057780?t=1760360775","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4057780?t=1760360775","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057780/2f2a2850d4d8d36c44e2844e27075ad4317514b0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760360775","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057780/2f2a2850d4d8d36c44e2844e27075ad4317514b0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760360775","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Old school RTS is back!</strong> <i>Outlive 25</i> is the remastered version of the game originally released in 2000, that will be featuring enhanced graphics and sound, an updated Campaign Editor, Steam multiplayer support, and much more. Get ready for a battle of unprecedented proportions, fought to achieve supremacy\u2014and above all\u2014to ensure humanity\u2019s survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057780/extras/a775e2fb0254a9f16dd79767c352d8a0.avif?t=1760360775\" width=616 height=84 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057780/extras/34e04f2fccde3d227d34c47700cb2f3c.poster.avif?t=1760360775\" width=800 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057780/extras/34e04f2fccde3d227d34c47700cb2f3c.webm?t=1760360775\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057780/extras/34e04f2fccde3d227d34c47700cb2f3c.mp4?t=1760360775\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Outlive\u00a025</i> is a real-time strategy game where your skills will be tested across incredible scenarios in epic campaigns for the survival of the human race and planet Earth. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In this demo version, get ready to play Outlive 25's official PRE-CAMPAIGN</strong>: meet (or remember!) the basic machanics and witness the very beginning of this adventure. Three full campaigns will be available in the full game once it is released.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo only supports single player mode. Outlive 25's full version will also feature multiplayer for up to 16 players simultaneously.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057780/extras/00b8ea834ad167fa0501953ef600240d.poster.avif?t=1760360775\" width=800 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057780/extras/00b8ea834ad167fa0501953ef600240d.webm?t=1760360775\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057780/extras/00b8ea834ad167fa0501953ef600240d.mp4?t=1760360775\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MORE OF WHAT YOU WILL FIND IN THE FULL GAME:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Campaign Editor:</strong>\u00a0Create and share your own maps and campaigns with friends and other players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Research Tree:</strong> Upgrade your units and make your buildings more efficient during matches, making each battle unique.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Espionage &amp; Counterespionage:</strong> Scout enemy bases, intercept incoming missiles, and carry out other covert actions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pathing System:</strong> Automate unit behaviors so you can focus entirely on your strategy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diplomacy:</strong> Forge alliances with other armies to take down your opponents.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Continuum Entertainment"],"fullgame":{"appid":"2948680","name":"Outlive 25"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057780/c1c17fd45930a88178cd3c689a552787d9804c42/header.jpg?t=1760360775","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4057780/1793755465/9e047cc4794d1b63d1d4f366f2b9ffeb1c2b2df5/1760102048/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760115921","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4057780/1793755465/9e047cc4794d1b63d1d4f366f2b9ffeb1c2b2df5/1760102048/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760115921","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4057780/1793755465/9e047cc4794d1b63d1d4f366f2b9ffeb1c2b2df5/1760102048/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1760115921","id":257215662,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257215662/movie480.mp4?t=1760115921","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257215662/movie_max.mp4?t=1760115921"},"name":"Outlive 25 - Demo Release Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257215662/96ee9275ef93c9b425a2ea04316990cb36f8cbd1/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1760115921","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/25721